2 CONC . 133–149. doi:10.1017/S1356186306005979. ISSN 1356-1863.
2 CONT * Redford, Scott (1991). "The Alaeddin Mosque in Konya Reconsidered". Artibus Asiae (Zürich: Artibus Asiae Publishers) 51 (1/2): pp. 54–74. doi:10.2307/3249676. ISSN 0004-3648. JSTOR 3249676.
2 CONT
