2 CONT
2 CONT Burhān al-Dīn is reputed to have had 4 children: [https://www.geni.com/people/Mu%E1%B8%A5ammad/6000000204997837832 Muḥammad] (died 1390), [https://www.geni.com/people/Zayn-al-Abidin/6000000204997018912 Zayn al-‘Abidin], [https://w
2 CONC ww.geni.com/people/Ful%C4%81na/6000000204997264887 Fulāna], and [https://www.geni.com/people/%E1%B8%A4ab%C4%ABba-Selj%C5%ABq-Kh%C4%81t%C5%ABn/6000000204997532848 Ḥabība Seljūq Khātūn] (died 1446). 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/Zayn-al-Abidin/6000000204997018912 Zayn al-‘Abidin] reigned for a few weeks after his father's demise. Burhān al-Dīn's daughters married Dulkadirid rulers. [https://www.geni.com/people/Ful%C4%81na/6000
2 CONC 000204997264887 Fulāna] married [https://www.geni.com/people/Nas%C4%B1reddin-Muhammed-Bey-Dulkadirid-Khan/6000000028607631748 Nasir al-Dīn Mehmed Beg], and [https://www.geni.com/people/%E1%B8%A4ab%C4%ABba-Selj%C5%ABq-Kh%C4%81t%C5%
2 CONC ABn/6000000204997532848 Ḥabība Seljūq Khātūn] married [https://www.geni.com/people/Suleiman-of-Dulkadir/6000000014341973604 Suleimān Beg]. [1] 
2 CONT
