2 CONT
2 CONT -https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_III_Crispo /!\ 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to a Morosini and had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Francesco III Crispo
2 CONT
2 CONT He also had a Mistress, his cousin, Maria Crispo, daughter of Nicholas Crispo Lord of Syros (Sira). They had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT *A daughter, name currently unknown.
2 CONT *A son, Nicholas Antonio Crispo de Syra (Sira). married to Taddea Sommaripa fled to Rhodes Island circa 1520.
