1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marta was a Georgian princess royal of the Bagrationi dynasty, and a wife of the Safavid Iranian king (shah) Abbas I (r. 1588-1629).[1] She married Abbas I on 20 September 1604.[1] The two divorced in ca. 1614.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marta was a daughter of David I by his wife Ketevan, daughter of Ashotan I, Prince of Mukhrani.[1]
