1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Ayşe Sultan (daughter of Bayezid II)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Ayşe Sultan (Ottoman Turkish: عائشه سلطان, "The Living One" or "womanly", c. 1465 - c. 1515) was an Ottoman princess, the daughter of Sultan Bayezid II and one of his concubine, Nigar Hatun. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(daughter_of_Bayezid_II)_ En], [https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(II._Bayezid%27in_k%C4%B1z%C4%B1)_ Tr]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(daughter_of_Bayezid_II)#Marriage Marriage]===
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ay%C5%9Fe_Sultan_(daughter_of_Bayezid_II)#Issue Issue]===
2 CONT By her [https://www.geni.com/people/G%C3%BCveyi-Sinan-Pasha/6000000205086883882 husband], Ayşe Sultan had two sons and five daughters:
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Ahmed-Bey-governor-of-Vize/6000000205087093847 Sultanzade Ahmed Bey], governor of Vize, married in January 1506[6] to the [https://www.geni.com/people/daughter-of-Hasan-Pasha/6000000205087
2 CONC 339835 daughter] of [https://www.geni.com/people/Hasan-Pasha-governor-of-Rumelia/6000000205087487834 Hasan Pasha], governor of Rumelia.[7] He had a daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevherhan-Hanim/6000000205086993885 Gevherh
2 CONC an Hanim].[8]
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Mustafa-Bey/6000000205087433861 Sultanzade Mustafa Bey].
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Hanzade-Ay%C5%9Fe-Mihrihan-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205085989037 Hanzade Ayşe Mihrihan Hanımsultan], married in November 1503 to his cousin [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Dukakinzade-Mehmed-A
2 CONC hmed-Bey/6000000205087807821 Sultanzade Dukakinzade Mehmed Ahmed Bey] (son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevherm%C3%BCl%C3%BCk-Sultan/6000000029696787207 Gevhermuluk Sultan]), Sanjak Bey of Ankara.[9] She had a daughter, [https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/people/Mihrimah-Hanim/6000000205087720834 Mihrimah Hanim].
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevher%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205086825844 Gevherşah Hanımsultan]. She first married [https://www.geni.com/people/Dukaginzade-Ahmed-Pasha/6000000205076373823 Dukakinoğlu Ahmed Pasha], with w
2 CONC hom she had a son, [https://www.geni.com/people/Dukanginzade-Ibrahim-Pasha/6000000205087505857 Dukanginzade Ibrahim Pasha], (d. 1582, who married his cousin [https://www.geni.com/people/Nesli%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205089
2 CONC 183834 Neslişah Hanımsultan], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevherm%C3%BCl%C3%BCk-Sultan/6000000029696787207 Gevhermülük Sultan]) and a daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Fatma-Han%C4%B1m/6000000205087861894 Fatma H
2 CONC anim] (who in 1518 married [https://www.geni.com/people/Iskender-Bey-governor-of-Antalya/6000000205095612840 Iskender Bey], governor of Antalya). In second marriage, she married [https://www.geni.com/people/Ibrahim-Bey-governor-of
2 CONC -Filorine/6000000205095509861 Ibrahim Bey] (son of [https://www.geni.com/people/%C3%96mer-Bey/6000000205095689859 Ömer Bey] and brother of her sister [https://www.geni.com/people/Mihrihan-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205095871821 Mihri
2 CONC han Hanımsultan's] [https://www.geni.com/people/Hasan-Bey/6000000205095889826 husband]). They had a son, [https://www.geni.com/people/Iskender-Bey/6000000205096165826 Iskender Bey], and a daughter, [https://www.geni.com/people/Hac
2 CONC %C4%B1-Rukiye-Han%C4%B1m/6000000205096056834 Hacı Rukiye Hanım]. She died in Aleppo on 4 April 1552.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Kamer%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205091244835 Kamerşah Hanımsultan],[10] married on 6 July 1506 to [https://www.geni.com/people/Ahmed-Bey/6000000205091244840 Ahmed Bey], son of [https://www.geni
2 CONC .com/people/Ali-Bey/6000000205091633822 Ali Bey], and the grandson of [https://www.geni.com/people/Mesih-Pasha/6000000205090503896 Mesih Pasha], a progeny of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palaiologos Palaiologos dynasty] (fat
2 CONC her of her sister [https://www.geni.com/people/Fatma-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205090923874 Fatma Hanımsultan's] [https://www.geni.com/people/Ali-Bey/6000000205091298842 husband]). The union was made by her [https://www.geni.com/peo
2 CONC ple/Ay%C5%9Fe-Sultan/6000000029696926961 mother], who was then a widow.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Fatma-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205090923874 Fatma Hanımsultan], married on 28 June 1506 to [https://www.geni.com/people/Ali-Bey/6000000205091298842 Ali Bey], son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Mesih-
2 CONC Pasha/6000000205091195848 Mesih Pasha] and father of her sister [https://www.geni.com/people/Kamer%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205091244835 Kamerşah Hanımsultan's] [https://www.geni.com/people/Ahmed-Bey/6000000205091244840 hus
2 CONC band]. She had a son, [https://www.geni.com/people/Ahmed-Bey/6000000205096501830 Ahmed Bey], who married his cousin, the daughter of Fatma Sultan.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Mihrihan-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205095871821 Mihrihan Hanımsultan],[11] married in 1505 to [https://www.geni.com/people/Hasan-Bey/6000000205095889826 Hasan Bey],[12] son of [https://www.geni.com/peo
2 CONC ple/%C3%96mer-Bey/6000000205095689859 Ömer Bey] and brother of her sister [https://www.geni.com/people/Gevher%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205086825844 Gevherşah Hanımsultan's] second [https://www.geni.com/people/Ibrahim-Bey-go
2 CONC vernor-of-Filorine/6000000205095509861 husband],[13] governor of Filorine.[14]
2 CONT
