1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Gevhermüluk Sultan'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gevherm%C3%BCluk_Sultan En], [https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gevherim%C3%BCluk_Sultan Tr]
2 CONT
2 CONT Gevhermüluk Sultan, "gem of the king", was an Ottoman Sultana. She was the daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Bayezid-II-of-the-Ottoman-Empire/385226639660012698 Bayezid II]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gevherm%C3%BCluk_Sultan#Early_life Early life]===
2 CONT
2 CONT She married [https://www.geni.com/people/Dukakinzade-Mehmed-Pasha/6000000205088299827 Dukakinzade Mehmed Pasha], son of Grand Vizier [https://www.geni.com/people/Damat-Dukakinzade-Ahmed-Pasha/6000000029696854213 Dukakinzade Ahmed 
2 CONC Pasha] [2], governor of Smederevo, Kyustendil, Karaman and finally Allepo. He died in 1557.[3] Their son was [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Dukakinzade-Mehmed-Ahmed-Bey/6000000205087807821 Sultanzade Dukakinzade Mehmed Ah
2 CONC med Bey] (died 1537) and their daughter was [https://www.geni.com/people/Nesli%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205089183834 Neslişah Hanımsultan] (1507–1579), who had built her own mosque in 1522 named after her.[4] [https://www.g
2 CONC eni.com/people/Sultanzade-Dukakinzade-Mehmed-Ahmed-Bey/6000000205087807821 Ahmed Bey] was known as a Divan poet who married [https://www.geni.com/people/Hanzade-Ay%C5%9Fe-Mihrihan-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205085989037 Hanzade Ayşe 
2 CONC Mihrihan Hanımsultan], daughter of his aunt [https://www.geni.com/people/Ay%C5%9Fe-Sultan/6000000029696926961 Ayşe Sultan]. [https://www.geni.com/people/Nesli%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205089183834 Neslişah Hanimsultan] marr
2 CONC ied [https://www.geni.com/people/Iskender-Pasha/6000000205088488913 Iskender Pasha] and after his cousin [https://www.geni.com/people/Dukanginzade-Ibrahim-Pasha/6000000205087505857 Dukaginzade Ibrahim Pasha ] (died 1582, son of Ay
2 CONC şe Sultan and grandson of Bayezid II '''(*)'''; and of [https://www.geni.com/people/Damat-Dukakinzade-Ahmed-Pasha-24th-Grand-Vizier-Dec-1514-Mar-1515/6000000029696854213 Dukakinoğlu Ahmed Pasha], [https://www.geni.com/people/Nesli
2 CONC %C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205089183834 Neslişah's] grandfather).[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note:''' '''(*)''' Above at wikipedia source written wrong: "Dukaginzade Ibrahim Pasha (died 1582, son of Ayşe Sultan and grandson of Bayezid II; and of Dukakinoğlu Ahmed Pasha, Neslişah's grandfather).[5]" 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Correct is:''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Dukanginzade-Ibrahim-Pasha/6000000205087505857 Dukaginzade Ibrahim Pasha] (died 1582) was a son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Damat-Dukakinzade-Ahmed-Pasha-24th-Grand-Vizier-Dec-151
2 CONC 4-Mar-1515/6000000029696854213 Dukakinzade Ahmed Pasha] ([https://www.geni.com/people/Nesli%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205089183834 Neslişah's] grandfather) who was 24th Grand Vizier (Dec 1514 - Mar 1515) and of his wife [htt
2 CONC ps://www.geni.com/people/Gevher%C5%9Fah-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000205086825844 Gevherşah Hanımsultan] who was daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Ay%C5%9Fe-Sultan/6000000029696926961 Ayşe Sultan] (and granddaughter of [https://
2 CONC www.geni.com/people/Bayezid-II-of-the-Ottoman-Empire/385226639660012698 Bayezid II]) and her husband [https://www.geni.com/people/G%C3%BCveyi-Sinan-Pasha/6000000205086883882 Güveyi Sinan Pasha]. So [https://www.geni.com/people/Duk
2 CONC anginzade-Ibrahim-Pasha/6000000205087505857 Dukaginzade Ibrahim Pasha] was not [https://www.geni.com/people/Ay%C5%9Fe-Sultan/6000000029696926961 Ayşe Sultan's] son and grandson of [https://www.geni.com/people/Bayezid-II-of-the-Ott
2 CONC oman-Empire/385226639660012698 Bayezid II], he was [https://www.geni.com/people/Ay%C5%9Fe-Sultan/6000000029696926961 Ayşe Sultan's grandson] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Bayezid-II-of-the-Ottoman-Empire/385226639660012698 Baye
2 CONC zid II 's] great-grandson. 
2 CONT
