2 CONT # Sakaoğlu, Necdet; Bu Mülkün Sultanları, page 137.
2 CONT # Beosch, Moritz. The Height of the Ottoman Power; Murder of Prince Mustafa
2 CONT # A General History of the Middle East, Chapter 13: Ottoman Era, Suleiman the Magnificent
