2 CONT Safiye Hanımsultan (1562 - ?): [https://www.geni.com/people/Ismihan-Sultan/6000000028525957697 Ismihan Sultan's] eldest child. She was firstly married to her father's cousin Sokollu Mustafa Pasha, governor of Buda. After his execu
2 CONC tion in 1578, she married the new governor of Buda, Silahdar Cafer Pasha. After his death in 1587, she gave birth to their twin sons, Mehmed Bey and Cafer Bey, who died as children. She married thirdly to Sultanzade Abdülbaki Bey,
2 CONC  son of her mother's cousin Hümaşah Sultan.
2 CONT
