2 CONC Krämer, Denis Matringe, John Nawas, Everett Rowson. Brill Online, 2012. Reference. Accessed 10 July 2012 <http://referenceworks.brillonline.com/entries/encyclopaedia-of-islam-3/ahmed-i-COM_22989> Börekçi, "Mustafa I," p.409. Börek
