1 NOTE {geni:about_me} IMPORTANT NOTE
2 CONT
2 CONT It is my belief that this Marton belongs to an alrternative Dadanyi line.  
2 CONT
2 CONT His son, also Marton, marriage record states he was born in Romhány, Nograd, Hungary in 1884.   As yet we have found no other members of the Dadanyi family being born in Romhány.  
2 CONT
2 CONT As we have no wish to loose all the research done on him and his descendants, the line can be split from the Aristoratic Dadanyi line or be temporarily placed here until the specific Dadanyi line is positively identified.  Roy
