2 CONC nd Extracts of the Manuscripts in the Library of the King of France. 2. R. Faulder. 1789. p. 46. Evliya Çelebi (1 January 1991). The Intimate Life of an Ottoman Statesman, Melek Ahmed Pasha (1588-1662): As Portrayed in Evliya Cele
2 CONC bi's Book of Travels (Seyahat-name). SUNY Press. p. 265. ISBN 978-0-7914-0640-3.
