1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Prince (Shahzada), Principe Lorenzo Said, 11th Principe de Sayd, 6th Principe di Bibino Magno (1677 - died c.1770), married 1723 Mosta, Malta to Teresa Xiriha di Cristoforo, (Matro: Not Bart Mangion) Lorenzo led an
2 CONC  interesting life, in the merchant trade. Enjoying countries such as Italy , France , Turkey , Spain and Tunis , his adventures were rewarded with success and survival battling against pirates and Arabs. Eventually retiring back i
2 CONC n Malta to marry his long awaiting love, whom he was able to settle down and have a family. Though it is said he had itchy feet, wanting to go back to the seas, with his cousins, (Vassallo) whom he spent much of his travels with. 
2 CONC Upon settling down, a man of his late forties, seeing his brothers with maturing children, it was high time to start one of his own.
